        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "상대를 맹독의 상태로 만든다.\n턴이 진행될수록\n독의 데미지가 증가한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "讓對手陷入劇毒狀態。\n中毒傷害會隨著\n回合的進行而增加。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Empoisonne gravement l’ennemi.\nLes dégâts dus au poison augmentent à chaque tour.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Vergiftet das Ziel mit einem potenten Toxin schwer.\nDie Vergiftung wird von Runde zu Runde stärker.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Envenena gravemente al objetivo y causa un daño\nmayor en cada turno.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Iperavvelena il bersaglio con una potente tossina.\nIl danno peggiora a ogni turno.",
