        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A move that leaves the target badly poisoned.\nIts poison damage worsens every turn.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "相手を　猛毒の　状態に　する。\nターンが　すすむほど\n毒の　ダメージが　増えていく。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
